WEBVTT

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:14.160
<i>When you asked me how I felt about you</i>

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:20.500
<i>I said, "You're okay, I guess."</i>

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.240
<i>Wait, are you crying?</i>

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>Oh!</i>

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.710
<i>Now I think you might be cute.</i>

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:37.220
<i>Then you tried to run away so I grabbed your hand.</i>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:42.990
<i>And something deep within my heart began to dance.</i>

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:49.190
<i>I wish there were a textbook for romance.</i>

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:55.300
<i>There are just too many problems I don't understand.</i>

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:01.440
<i>I wish there were a teacher for romance.</i>

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:03.740
<i>If I add You + Me</i>

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:08.210
<i>Will the answer be "Love"?</i>

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.190
Then I challenge you!

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.890
Whichever of us gets a boyfriend/girlfriend first...

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.690
If I win, what do I get?

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:24.160
I'll buy you your favorite game.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.900
And if I win, you're buying me new basketball sneakers!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.870
Challenge accepted!

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.900
I'm gonna win!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:38.240
Love Triangle With The Ex?!

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.750
What's with the 'do?

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.950
Scrub brush? Sea urchin?

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:47.020
Shaddup!

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:48.690
I'm a hot guy today.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.450
Scrub brush, sea urchin

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.190
Makes me REALLY wanna mess it up.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:52.760
Hands off, moron!

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.060
Tryin' to be sexy? Disgusting.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.260
All the girls are gonna ask me out today.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.500
Then you'll have to buy me new sneakers.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:06.240
Don't tell me you seriously think spiking your hair will get you chicks.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.510
Don't tell me YOU seriously think lipstick will get you guys.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:15.410
Think fast!

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.220
Nobuko, Chiharu, let's go home!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.730
Hey, Darling, what'cha wanna do?

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.960
I dunno...

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.160
This is so awkward.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.930
The feeling is mutual.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.340
Why do YOU have to come with us?

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.040
I'm going to Nakao's house.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.910
I need help after SOMEONE ruined my hairstyle and made me late this morning.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.240
You're STILL pissed about that?

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.780
You're not only small bodied - you're small minded.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.650
I'm gonna sue!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:51.880
Be my guest.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:56.020
Game Center All the latest products here!!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:54.190
Nakaochi, wanna have our fortune told?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.620
What fortune?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:59.020
Prrrrring

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:03.260
Your Compatibility: 85%. Congratulations

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.960
Yay! It says our compatibility is 85%!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.730
Love Compatibility Check

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.160
Chiharu, Suzuki, won't you try it?

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.000
Come on, try it!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:11.940
Sure.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:14.810
Gotcha! Gotcha!

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.040
Hey! Hey!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:27.720
What do you want?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.090
Nobuko, you're ordering a full meal?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:29.820
Yeah.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.960
Oh yeah, Otani, wanna go to a Sea Monk concert?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.330
A friend of mine had two extra tickets,

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.730
but he can't find anyone who wants them.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.770
Sea Monk? For real? I'll go!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.940
Koizumi, you like him too?

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.210
I freaking LOVE him! He's so sick.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.510
Isn't he? He's SO sick!

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:50.880
Did you hear his new track?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.340
Of course I did! It was freaking AWESOME!

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.510
I'm so glad you like it. That track is so sick.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.510
Yeah, it is!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.320
Why don't you two go out?

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.220
Yeah.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.220
Huh?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:01.990
What the hell are you suggesting?!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.360
You're always in perfect sync with each other.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.220
I think you're probably very compatible too.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.090
In what way, specifically?

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.560
In the Sea Monk way, specifically.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.330
Just a coincidence - great balls of fire!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.670
A lady shouldn't say "balls".

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.670
It's an IDIOM - I didn't mean "TESTICLES"!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.300
See? No way would I date this crass woman.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.470
You're one to talk, Mister!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.140
Um, are you ready to order?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.080
Ah, give me a minute, please...

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:35.090
New Item: Have a tropical experience with our Hawaiian Dancer

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:35.090
Oooh, new stuff on the!? Can't pass this up.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.490
Hawaiian Dancer!

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.160
See?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.330
You're! Wrong!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.770
I wanna meet my prince!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.340
Like I said, just go with Otani.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:54.140
- Right, Chiharu?
- Yeah.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.870
Stop it! Why would I date such a runt?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.340
I can't date someone unless he's taller than me.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.980
But Otani is actually a catch.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.750
There she goes again. You're a very funny girl...

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.920
If you doubt me, wanna check out basketball practice after school?

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.160
Look. Those girls.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.870
They're probably a  couple years older than him...

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.470
He caught the ball!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:24.640
Go for it!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.970
...And they're always squealing over Otani.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:29.310
Seriously?

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.750
Woah, for a runt he's not bad.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.020
Wow, he jumps really high.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.520
Hey, Otani!

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.590
You're little - you're in no position to hog the glory and go for a dunk there!

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.490
- Why is the coach yelling at him?

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.060
- Pass it to a different player next time!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.230
- He made the shot.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:50.930
Yeah.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.730
Know your place, runt.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.570
Wow, that old man is really pissing me off!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:57.870
Now, now...

00:05:59.240 --> 00:05:59.740
Yes, sir.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.710
Aww! That stupid coach yelled at him again.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:06.640
That's for sure!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.480
- Cuuuuuute!

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.480
- See?

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.350
- Bless his little heart!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.650
- He's "cute"?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.880
- Poor thing!

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:14.120
- That's right! Little people can always play that card!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:15.920
That's playing dirty...

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:23.060
What's with the ugly face?

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:27.630
Awww, using the widdle flower pins to makes you pwetty?

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.800
Huh? These're my sister's.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.370
Awww, what a cute widdle boy.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.640
You wook wike a girl.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.640
You wanna fist in your mouth?!

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.680
I won't let you beat me!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.110
You think I'm gonna buy you sneakers?

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:46.220
You're buying me a mountain of new video games instead!

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.960
What's eating her?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.660
I've gotta do something!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.590
I've just gotta...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.600
That's it!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:58.700
Nobuko!

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.400
A group date! Group date!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:03.870
Group date?

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:09.740
All right! I'm gonna bag me a hottie tonight.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.640
Risa!

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.710
Sorry I'm late.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:15.880
Horse...

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:17.720
Monkey...

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.420
Bird...

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.350
Dog...

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.090
And a pig?

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:25.690
Hello!

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:27.290
Craaaaash.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.560
What is this, a zoo?

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.470
Oh well, I like the zoo.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.700
Zoos are fun.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:39.200
I'm a giraffe as it is.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.410
Fine. It's okay. I'm okay with this.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.510
It's what's inside that counts.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:48.010
Koziumi, dearrrr.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:54.020
What's wrong? You need to let loose more.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.360
By the way, how tall are you?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.590
...There it is.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.460
170cm. (5'7)

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.470
Wow, that's tall.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:13.910
If you're that tall already, you'll be 3 meters by the time you graduate.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.370
Just kidding.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:18.810
Oh, you.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.450
Aren't I funny?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.280
People always laugh at me!

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:26.450
Well, I just can't laugh.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:29.750
I'm always treated this way.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.500
Hey, how'd it go last night?

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.330
Can't you tell by my depressed face?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.470
Risa, your standards are unrealistically high.

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:43.970
Hey! You have a boyfriend!

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.400
You have no right to brush off my plight by saying my ideals are too high!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.840
Sure, I've got a list of qualities I'm looking for,

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.610
But I don't actually think the perfect guy exists...

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:53.710
Sob, sob, sob

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.710
Flood

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.350
You're right! My ideals are too high.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.920
Risa...

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.050
I know.

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:05.090
As a person...as a woman, I'm in trouble.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.060
You're in trouble, Koizumi.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:11.330
I know! I'm a very troubled person.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.500
No, I mean this. Very bad news.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:18.300
Sea Monk 3 Day Tour

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:21.540
It's a Sea Monk ticket!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.680
Nakao just gave it to me.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.540
It's a Sea Monk CHRISTMAS Concert.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:26.740
Christm...!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:30.520
December 25th, the most romantic day of the year.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:37.760
W-Why do I have to spend my Christmas with you like a LOSER?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.190
Beats me! And I'd ask the exact same thing!

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.360
OF YOU!!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.730
Moronic. Dear lord, why?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.030
Egads, why?

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.370
What country are you guys from?

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:53.140
It's okay. You can go together.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:53.910
No!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.840
Why must the All Hanshin Kyojin...

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:58.110
desecrate the romantic streets of Christmas with our awkward presence?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.410
Maybe you'll get caught in the flow of Christmas and find romance!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.280
If this chick gets caught in a flow, she'll clog up the drain.

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:06.280
I'll clog YOUR drain!

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:21.070
Even if we walk side by side in the romantic streets of Christmas day,

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.930
I doubt romance will blossom.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:23.740
English Lessons

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.170
You sneeze like an old man.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:28.810
I've been feeling sickish lately.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.680
Are ya taking this boyfriend stuff seriously?

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:34.780
I am, I am! Our challenge still isn't over.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.380
You have no plans for Christmas, do ya.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.020
Nope.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.860
Let's just go straight to the concert and straight home.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.890
Wouldn't want romance to bloom in the wrong climate

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.960
Even if we took our time going there and back,

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.300
I doubt romance would bloom.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.800
Probably right.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:11:00.000
I mean, what's your type anyway?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.910
My type?

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:04.940
At the very least, someone who doesn't sneeze like a man in his sixties.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.910
When a lady sneezes, she delicately puts a hand to her mouth...

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:10.980
See, like that.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:20.290
A Chiharu with different colored hair?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.830
Is that even possible?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.030
But...but...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:27.000
There's two Chiharus??

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.670
Kanzaki...

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.270
Atsushi.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.310
What's going on?

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.480
Kanzaki...

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:45.950
Atsushi.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.890
"Atsushi"? Who's that?

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.360
Me.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.890
Long time no see.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.160
Yeah.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:58.700
You doing okay?

00:11:58.700 --> 00:11:59.360
Yeah.

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.330
That scared me.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:06.300
She really looks exactly like Chiharu.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:09.040
Um, so, I've got somewhere to be...

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.790
Hey, hey, Atsushi, who was that?

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.820
Doesn't matter.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:27.360
Oh please, Atsushi, you can tell me!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:29.190
Something's up, you dog.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:31.660
...She's my ex-girlfriend.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.010
Your ex-girlfriend?

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.740
You DATED her??

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.640
Is it really THAT hard to believe?

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.110
Are you telling the truth?

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.050
Why would I lie?

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.320
I don't see it! You're too Otani-ish for her!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.380
Listen, you...

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.420
If a person's 15 or 16, he's bound to have dated at least once!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.590
Well, I haven't!

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.360
Is that something to brag about?

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.330
Shock...

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.430
Shock to the highest.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.600
Otani has an ex-girlfriend?

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.770
He's way too Otani-ish for that!

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:16.740
Hey, so Nakaochi told me about her.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.510
Her name's Mayu Kanzaki.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:24.050
She managed Otani and Nakao's junior high basketball team.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:27.620
He says they dated for two years.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:32.620
-And apparently Otani was the one who was more attached.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.620
- So it's true...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:46.500
I'd thought that like me, Otani had never dated anyone.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.610
Now I really feel like a late-bloomer.

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:52.640
Hey, Otani, why did you guys break up?

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.410
Why do you want to know?

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.480
Well, I just can't picture it!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.820
You dating or breaking up with someone...

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:06.460
We didn't break up... She dumped me.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:09.790
Um...

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.600
She fell for someone else and that was it.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.400
I was depressed enough as it was,

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.600
but then I found out who my replacement was...

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:22.440
He was 2 meters tall and dubbed, "the Giant Stallion of West Jr. High."

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:27.050
She really knew how to twist the knife...

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.180
But I'm sure it was just a coincidence!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.920
I doubt she chose him for his height.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.280
Even if it was a coincidence...

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:38.390
It certainly didn't help my already delicate complex over my height.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.200
I guess if I say any more, you'll punch me again.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.340
Otani...

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.910
I see.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.810
So he had that kind of past.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.780
May you find happiness!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:16.360
Otani, I know all too well how you feel!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:21.200
Being dumped like that would only make you feel worse about your height.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.500
Keep at it, Otani!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.900
Stay optimistic, Otani!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:35.580
I forgot my bag!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.650
Will you wait for me while I get it?

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:52.860
So, everyone who was on the basketball team...

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.670
is getting together on the 25th for a party.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:58.270
Could you leave that day open for us?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.140
Okay.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.740
The more I look, the more I see the resemblance to Chiharu.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:08.150
No, I think Chiharu looks like HER, not the other way around.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:12.450
THAT'S probably why Otani was attracted to Chiharu.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.520
Promise you'll come, okay?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.560
There's something I want to talk about.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.360
Bye.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:30.800
What's that? Why's he spacing out?

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.570
Could it be...he still likes her?

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.340
Oh, the 25th is--

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.080
Don't worry! I'll go to Sea Monk's concert alone!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.380
K-Koizumi, how long have you been there?

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:49.320
She wants to talk, eh? Probably wants to get back together.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.190
And if you can't go to the party and get back together with her,

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.130
it'll be all my fault.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:55.860
Lucky break.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.400
Getting back together with your ex...

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:59.200
will help you beat me in the challenge...

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:02.170
much faster than finding someone new.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.370
Koizumi...

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.440
Ah, but since I'm helping to make this happen,

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.970
I'm not buying ya new sneakers.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:11.040
I don't mind taking you out to tea or something, though.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:11.810
Cheapskate.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.280
'Tis the season!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:17.750
Sometimes I'm not sure whether you're nice or not.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.050
I'm nice, of course.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.890
Oh, really?

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:27.390
After all... how can I abandon such a passionate face?

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.060
He surprised me.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.170
Nobuko, Chiharu, so the situation is thus...

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.770
"The situation is thus"?

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.500
I's gonna be alllll alone on Christmas.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:42.240
Could you's please spend some time with me's before the concert?

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:44.810
Please?

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.020
Um, if you're busy we could always do this on the 24th...

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.280
Sorry.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:57.020
On the 24th I'm going to an overnight Christmas Party with Darling.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:00.990
And I haven't finished knitting the scarf I'm giving Suzuki,

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.430
so I'll be busy...

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.960
But maybe if I hurry through it now I can make time...

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.640
Oh, whatever! Just leave me in peace!

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.400
Don't worry! We still love you!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.010
But we just can't...

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:17.710
Whatever! Christmas isn't a Japanese holiday anyway!

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.840
Makes no difference to me if I'm alone or not!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.060
Aw, crap. I was so bored I came too early...

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.930
That hurt, you jerk!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:42.000
My tights! Infection! Blood!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.210
Right about now...

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.540
They're probably having the time of their lives.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:55.910
And Otani's probably back with his ex.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.250
What should I do?

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.390
I'm all alone now.

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.120
If Otani has a girlfriend,

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.990
he probably won't hang out with me anymore.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.290
What should I do?

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.290
Winter vacation is a time to party...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.430
but I'll probably just get in everyone's way.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.070
My knee hurts...

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:18.370
And the concert is about to start.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:22.810
What if I love the concert?

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:25.240
Who am I supposed to share that feeling with?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.010
Though he can be annoying at times...

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.080
It's sure dismal without him.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.850
Koizumi!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.160
Is that Otani's voice?

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.530
Otani...

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:46.200
Finally found you!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.130
Otani...

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.970
Where WERE you?

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.040
What're you doing here?

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.300
What'm I doing? Seeing Sea Monk, of course!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:55.370
But what about your ex?

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:58.940
I'll see her some other time.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.050
I promised you first.

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:05.250
I almost didn't come...

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.650
but I didn't want to flake out on you like that.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.890
I didn't want to be in your debt.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:13.260
You really are a moron.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.590
You're a moron.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:21.130
Wh-wh-why are you crying?

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.270
You're a moron!

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:26.740
- Why are you doing this?

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.740
- Why'm I a moron?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.750
Koizumi...what's wrong?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:36.580
C...conk.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:37.780
"Conk"?

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:41.190
Conk...I...conk...

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:42.420
What're you, a rooster?

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.460
I conked my knee!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.560
Your knee?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.560
Wow, you're right! It's bleeding!

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:49.590
What did you do?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.030
Are you okay? Can you walk?

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.100
Yeah.

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:55.930
Let's go to the gig.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:05.840
Otani's hand...is so warm.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:12.280
Merry Christmas! MC of the M-Sea, Sea Monk!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:20.990
That was AWESOME!

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.530
Yeah, I freaking DIED!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.860
- Freaking sick!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:25.630
- It's Christmas in the streets.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.500
- Perhaps something can bloom,

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:27.500
- So sick!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:30.000
even for the All Hanshin Kyojin.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.340
Risa.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.240
Risa!!

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:58.330
<i>On the way home from school, alone in the park, sitting on our bench,</i>

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:03.170
<i>I noticed you were happier than usual</i>

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.600
<i>So I asked you,</i>

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:12.880
<i>"What would you do if the world disappeared?"</i>

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:21.020
<i>Saying nothing, you squeezed my arm in response.</i>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:26.990
<i>Please, keep looking at me.</i>

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>Our lips are too close and my heart won't stop pounding.</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>No matter what mood you're in, I'll accept you for who you are.</i>

00:22:42.140 --> 00:22:50.610
<i>And if your heart ever breaks and tears fall down your cheeks,</i>

00:22:50.610 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>I will protect you even if it means turning the rest of the world against me.</i>

00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:58.060
<i>I love you</i>

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>I don't need words.</i>

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:07.160
<i>You will be my last kiss.</i>

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:11.840
<i>Now and forever.</i>

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:28.020
Otani, here's your obligatory chocolate.

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:30.390
- No thanks.
- But you asked for it!

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:32.790
Why don't'cha give it to that Haruka guy!

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:34.690
Lovely Complex - Love Com.

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:37.300
Next episode: "The Boy You Like? The Boy From Your Past?"

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:40.000
The Boy You Like? The Boy From Your Past?

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:39.230
Don't miss it!
